  {
   "title": "响应拦截器依x-encrypt头自动解密",
   "type": "fact",
   "content": "`src/utils/request.js`响应拦截器在`x-encrypt`为`\"true\"`时，RSA解密`res.data.key`获AES密钥，AES-CBC零IV解密`res.data.data`并写回`res.data`。依赖经`public/assets/js/jsencrypt.min.js`与`vite.config.js`全局映射`JSEncrypt`引入。",
   "evidence": "extracted source=cursor session=1be0669b-af87-48b5-b7d1-43a62062a380",
   "files": [
    "d:/repository/宜兴公共收益/zhi2-web-admin/index.js",
